，而且餐點裡面還有多塊蛋殼，體驗非常差，食材不新鮮，炸物有明顯腥味，還好只是嚐鮮而已，之後絕不會再回訪。建議店面改成台式麵食館，會比拉麵店更貼切。",null,[0,235]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17880878189244040033/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhDTmxaRE1EVk1WMFYwVFc1Q1MxRnJTbnBqYTJ4U1UyczBkRlZXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4646,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCNlZDMDVMV0V0TW5CS1FrSnpja2xSU2s0dFVWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xbe1638669dd0784d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlB6VC05LWEtMnBKQkJzcklRSk4tUVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCNlZDMDVMV0V0TW5CS1FrSnpja2xSU2s0dFVWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCNlZDMDVMV0V0TW5CS1FrSnpja2xSU2s0dFVWRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCNlZDMDVMV0V0TW5CS1FrSnpja2xSU2s0dFVWRRILMGVKNkYwYUlLMUQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sQjZWQzA1TFdFdE1uQktRa0p6Y2tsUlNrNHRVVkUSCzBlSjZGMGFJSzFEIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARTXjQnWY4Fr4qCzBlSjZGMGFJSzFE\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u0